{"Title":"An Act providing school building assistance for special education collaboratives","BillNumber":"H569","DocketNumber":"HD2326","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJS1","Name":"Adam J. Scanlon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:23:09.15"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJS1","Name":"Adam J. Scanlon","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:23:09.15"},{"Id":"MPK1","Name":"Michael P. Kushmerek","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MPK1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:23:17.06"},{"Id":"JKH1","Name":"James K. Hawkins","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JKH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T13:22:13.9"},{"Id":"TTN1","Name":"Tram T. Nguyen","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/TTN1","ResponseDate":"2023-10-02T16:31:18.43"},{"Id":"JRO0","Name":"Jacob R. Oliveira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-21T14:49:34.3"},{"Id":"D_S1","Name":"Dawne Shand","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/D_S1","ResponseDate":"2023-09-18T09:50:26.3366667"},{"Id":"PSS1","Name":"Priscila S. Sousa","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PSS1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-14T13:07:44.7266667"},{"Id":"BLW1","Name":"Bud L. Williams","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BLW1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T14:52:26.8233333"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"MPK1","Name":"Michael P. Kushmerek","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MPK1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-19T12:23:09.15"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H569/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representatives Scanlon of North Attleborough and Kushmerek of Fitchburg, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 569) of Adam Scanlon, Michael P. Kushmerek and others relative to providing for school building assistance for special education collaboratives.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tSection 2 of Chapter 70B of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking the following phrase:-\r\n\t“Eligible applicant”, a city, town, regional school district or independent agricultural and technical school.\r\n\tAnd inserting in place thereof the following:-\r\n\t“Eligible applicant'', a city, town, regional school district or independent agricultural, technical school and Collaborative.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}